{"id":185,"date":"2017-05-08T22:27:27","date_gmt":"2017-05-08T22:27:27","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.domainconnect.org\/?page_id=185"},"modified":"2025-02-13T17:34:58","modified_gmt":"2025-02-13T17:34:58","slug":"inquiries","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/www.domainconnect.org\/inquiries\/","title":{"rendered":"Get Involved"},"content":{"rendered":"<h3>Interested in following the specification and contributing?<\/h3>\n<p>Changes to the specification can be tracked at <a href=\"https:\/\/github.com\/Domain-Connect\/spec\">https:\/\/github.com\/Domain-Connect\/spec<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Domain connect templates can also be tracked at <a href=\"https:\/\/github.com\/Domain-Connect\/templates\">https:\/\/github.com\/Domain-Connect\/templates<\/a><\/p>\n<h3>Interested in getting involved with the community?<\/h3>\n<p>We have a Slack channel at <a href=\"https:\/\/domainconnect.slack.com\">https:\/\/domainconnect.slack.com<\/a>.<\/p>\n<h3>Interested in supporting Domain Connect as a DNS Provider?<\/h3>\n<p>There is code to get started in github at <a href=\"https:\/\/github.com\/Domain-Connect\/DomainConnectApplyZone\">https:\/\/github.com\/Domain-Connect\/DomainConnectApplyZone<\/a>.<\/p>\n<h3>Interested in supporting Domain Connect as a Service Provider?<\/h3>\n<p>Again, we&#8217;ve got you covered.\u00a0 Start with the example service at https:\/\/exampleservice.domainconnect.org. The source code for this is at <a href=\"https:\/\/github.com\/Domain-Connect\/exampleservice\">https:\/\/github.com\/Domain-Connect\/exampleservice<\/a>.<\/p>\n<p>From there you can use the library at <a href=\"https:\/\/github.com\/Domain-Connect\/domainconnect_python\">https:\/\/github.com\/Domain-Connect\/domainconnect_python<\/a>.<\/p>\n<p>You&#8217;ll also need to define your service template. Examples can be found at <a href=\"https:\/\/github.com\/Domain-Connect\/templates\">https:\/\/github.com\/Domain-Connect\/templates<\/a>.<\/p>\n<h3>Still need help?<\/h3>\n<p>Join our Slack Workspace above and ask your questions in the #general channel. We are a group of individuals from multiple companies representing Service Providers and DNS Providers that have been instrumental in defining and shepherding the specification.<\/p>\n<p>The community will help you with your implementation, but to get going&#8230;<\/p>\n<p>As a DNS Provider we recommend that you start by implementing the synchronous protocol, using the <a href=\"https:\/\/exampleservice.domainconnect.org\/\">example service<\/a> to test your implementation. Once this is working, implement the asynchronous protocol.<\/p>\n<p>As a Service Provider, you&#8217;ll need to start with a template that defines your service.\u00a0You can then implement the protocol on your application using the <a href=\"https:\/\/exampleservice.domainconnect.org\/\">example service code<\/a> as a starting point. Then you&#8217;ll need to work with the DNS Providers to on board your template.<\/p>\n<p>Again, the community can help you with this process. We won&#8217;t bite.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Interested in following the specification and contributing? Changes to the specification can be tracked at https:\/\/github.com\/Domain-Connect\/spec Domain connect templates can&hellip;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":3,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-185","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.domainconnect.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/185","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.domainconnect.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.domainconnect.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/page"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.domainconnect.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/3"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.domainconnect.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=185"}],"version-history":[{"count":12,"href":"https:\/\/www.domainconnect.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/185\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":818,"href":"https:\/\/www.domainconnect.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/185\/revisions\/818"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.domainconnect.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=185"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}